    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d89">

                <pb facs="0176" n="120" sameAs="frus:frus1944Quebec/pg120"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the President</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1944-09-08">September 8, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum for the
                    President</hi></p>
                <p>In line with our personal conversation about answers to questions that Churchill
                    might ask, I herewith attach several documents which deal with the titles
                    indicated. I believe they will be of some use to you.</p>
                <closer><signed>C[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ordell</hi>] H[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">ull</hi>]</signed></closer>




